          "sampleId": "rounding-product-change",
          "tags": [
            "direct-causal-evidence"
          ],
          "rationale": "具体改动和直接调用该函数的断言值一致，形成产品回归证据。"
        },
        {
          "sampleId": "ordering-product-change",
          "tags": [
            "direct-causal-evidence"
          ],
          "rationale": "比较器方向改变直接解释顺序断言失败。"
        },
        {
          "sampleId": "unchanged-fixture-rerun",
          "tags": [
            "completed-unchanged-rerun"
          ],
          "rationale": "同命令完成失败后通过，明确代码、fixture、时钟等条件均不变。"
        },
        {
          "sampleId": "unchanged-chinese-rerun",
          "tags": [
            "multilingual",
